Except as indicated, acceleration and deceleration lanes shall be provided for new street and driveway connections to existing streets. The lanes will not be required if any of the following conditions are met:
(a) The driveway is for a one or two family residence;
(b) Total traffic on the existing roadway is less than 2000 vehicles per day (count of existing traffic must have been made within one year of the development plan submittal date);
(c) The driveway is for a small business with ingress/egress of less than 100 vehicles per day; or
(d) Construction cost of the lanes exceeds 25 percent of the estimated development cost.
